{
  "story_id": "three-days-on-the-atoll",
  "chapter": 2,
  "total_duration_ms": 326808,
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "On the first night, they sat by their small fire on the beach.",
      "start_ms": 1630,
      "end_ms": 5299
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "They had eaten two small fish that Tavita had caught in the reef with a hand-line he had had in the boat.",
      "start_ms": 5299,
      "end_ms": 11471
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "The fish had been grilled directly on the coals.",
      "start_ms": 11471,
      "end_ms": 14324
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "It had been a very simple meal — no salt, no rice, no vegetables — but Mala had been very hungry, and it had been one of the best meals she had ever had.",
      "start_ms": 14324,
      "end_ms": 23291
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "She said so.",
      "start_ms": 23291,
      "end_ms": 24048
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Her father laughed.",
      "start_ms": 24048,
      "end_ms": 25213
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "He said, \"Hunger is the best chef.",
      "start_ms": 25213,
      "end_ms": 27251
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "That is what my mother used to say.\"",
      "start_ms": 27251,
      "end_ms": 29464
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "The sky, when the sun went down, was — enormous.",
      "start_ms": 29464,
      "end_ms": 32317
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Mala had never seen a sky like this.",
      "start_ms": 32317,
      "end_ms": 34471
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "In Tarawa there were streetlights and houses and cooking fires everywhere.",
      "start_ms": 34471,
      "end_ms": 38839
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Here there was nothing.",
      "start_ms": 38839,
      "end_ms": 40236
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "The Milky Way arched across the sky.",
      "start_ms": 40236,
      "end_ms": 42391
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "There were more stars than she could believe.",
      "start_ms": 42391,
      "end_ms": 45069
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Her father lay back on the sand and looked up.",
      "start_ms": 45069,
      "end_ms": 47806
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "She lay back beside him.",
      "start_ms": 47806,
      "end_ms": 49261
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "They did not talk for a long time.",
      "start_ms": 49261,
      "end_ms": 51358
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "After a while her father said, \"Mala.",
      "start_ms": 51358,
      "end_ms": 53570
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "I want to talk to you about something.\" \"Yes?\" \"When I was your age — eleven — my father died.",
      "start_ms": 53570,
      "end_ms": 59102
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Suddenly.",
      "start_ms": 59102,
      "end_ms": 59684
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "On his boat.",
      "start_ms": 59684,
      "end_ms": 60441
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "His heart.",
      "start_ms": 60441,
      "end_ms": 61082
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Nobody had known it was going to happen.",
      "start_ms": 61082,
      "end_ms": 63469
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "He went out one morning, alone, and he did not come back.",
      "start_ms": 63469,
      "end_ms": 66847
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "My uncle found the boat that afternoon, empty.",
      "start_ms": 66847,
      "end_ms": 69583
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "They never found his body.",
      "start_ms": 69583,
      "end_ms": 71155
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "That was how it was.\" Mala had heard some of this before but not all of it.",
      "start_ms": 71155,
      "end_ms": 75581
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "She said, \"That is very sad, Papa.\" \"Yes,\" said her father.",
      "start_ms": 75581,
      "end_ms": 79075
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "\"It was very sad.",
      "start_ms": 79075,
      "end_ms": 80123
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "But — I want to tell you about it because it made me think, when I was your age, about my own dying.",
      "start_ms": 80123,
      "end_ms": 86004
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "I was scared for years.",
      "start_ms": 86004,
      "end_ms": 87401
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "That the same thing would happen to me.",
      "start_ms": 87401,
      "end_ms": 89730
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "That I would be on a boat with you someday and something would happen.",
      "start_ms": 89730,
      "end_ms": 93865
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "That you would be — I do not know.",
      "start_ms": 93865,
      "end_ms": 95903
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Alone.\"",
      "start_ms": 95903,
      "end_ms": 96427
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "\"I have thought about this every time I have taken you out on the boat,\" he said.",
      "start_ms": 96427,
      "end_ms": 101202
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "\"I know you love the boat.",
      "start_ms": 101202,
      "end_ms": 102774
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "I know I take you out anyway.",
      "start_ms": 102774,
      "end_ms": 104521
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "But I want you to know — I have always known there was a small chance that something would happen.",
      "start_ms": 104521,
      "end_ms": 110285
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "And I want you to know some things, if that ever does happen.",
      "start_ms": 110285,
      "end_ms": 113895
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Some things that would help.\"",
      "start_ms": 113895,
      "end_ms": 115584
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Her father sat up.",
      "start_ms": 115584,
      "end_ms": 116834
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "He said, \"First.",
      "start_ms": 116834,
      "end_ms": 117952
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "If we are ever separated on the water and I cannot help you — go to the nearest land.",
      "start_ms": 117952,
      "end_ms": 123609
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Do not try to sail all the way home.",
      "start_ms": 123609,
      "end_ms": 126043
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Go to whatever land you can see.",
      "start_ms": 126043,
      "end_ms": 128214
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Any land.",
      "start_ms": 128214,
      "end_ms": 128872
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Coconut palms will give you water.",
      "start_ms": 128872,
      "end_ms": 131174
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "That is the main thing on any of these small islands.",
      "start_ms": 131174,
      "end_ms": 134726
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "You will not die of thirst if there are coconut palms.",
      "start_ms": 134726,
      "end_ms": 138344
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "That is the main thing to know.\"",
      "start_ms": 138344,
      "end_ms": 140581
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "\"Second.",
      "start_ms": 140581,
      "end_ms": 141173
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "Fire is the second most important thing.",
      "start_ms": 141173,
      "end_ms": 143870
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "If you have matches — start a fire.",
      "start_ms": 143870,
      "end_ms": 146238
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "If not, you can use the little glass from the compass we keep in the boat as a magnifying glass — you can start a fire with sun and glass.",
      "start_ms": 146238,
      "end_ms": 155382
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "I have shown you before.",
      "start_ms": 155382,
      "end_ms": 157026
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Third.",
      "start_ms": 157026,
      "end_ms": 157487
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Do not panic.",
      "start_ms": 157487,
      "end_ms": 158408
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "Panic is what kills people in situations like this.",
      "start_ms": 158408,
      "end_ms": 161828
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "Not thirst.",
      "start_ms": 161828,
      "end_ms": 162618
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "Not hunger.",
      "start_ms": 162618,
      "end_ms": 163407
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Not sharks.",
      "start_ms": 163407,
      "end_ms": 164196
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "Panic.",
      "start_ms": 164196,
      "end_ms": 164657
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "If you stay calm, you can survive for a very long time on very little.\"",
      "start_ms": 164657,
      "end_ms": 169459
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "\"Papa,\" Mala said.",
      "start_ms": 169459,
      "end_ms": 170709
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "\"Are you going to die on the boat like your father did.\" Tavita was quiet for a long moment.",
      "start_ms": 170709,
      "end_ms": 176826
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "Then he said, \"I do not know, Mala.",
      "start_ms": 176826,
      "end_ms": 179195
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "I hope not.",
      "start_ms": 179195,
      "end_ms": 179984
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "I have taken care of my health.",
      "start_ms": 179984,
      "end_ms": 182089
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "I go to the doctor once a year.",
      "start_ms": 182089,
      "end_ms": 184194
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "My heart is fine, as far as I know.",
      "start_ms": 184194,
      "end_ms": 186562
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "I am forty-two.",
      "start_ms": 186562,
      "end_ms": 187615
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "Forty-two is not old.",
      "start_ms": 187615,
      "end_ms": 189062
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "I hope to be with you for many many years.",
      "start_ms": 189062,
      "end_ms": 191890
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "But — no one knows.",
      "start_ms": 191890,
      "end_ms": 193206
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "I am telling you these things because — I want you to know them.",
      "start_ms": 193206,
      "end_ms": 197482
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Not because I think it is going to happen.",
      "start_ms": 197482,
      "end_ms": 200310
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "Because I think — I owe you the knowledge.",
      "start_ms": 200310,
      "end_ms": 203139
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "Just in case.\"",
      "start_ms": 203139,
      "end_ms": 204192
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Mala nodded.",
      "start_ms": 204192,
      "end_ms": 205047
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "She was not scared, exactly.",
      "start_ms": 205047,
      "end_ms": 206954
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "She was — grateful, in a way she was not used to feeling.",
      "start_ms": 206954,
      "end_ms": 210770
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "Her father was talking to her like she was — an adult.",
      "start_ms": 210770,
      "end_ms": 214388
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Not entirely, but close.",
      "start_ms": 214388,
      "end_ms": 216032
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "He was telling her real things.",
      "start_ms": 216032,
      "end_ms": 218137
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "Not softening them.",
      "start_ms": 218137,
      "end_ms": 219453
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "She said, \"Papa.",
      "start_ms": 219453,
      "end_ms": 220571
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "Can you also tell me — if you did die — what should I do.",
      "start_ms": 220571,
      "end_ms": 224386
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "Not just for surviving on a boat.",
      "start_ms": 224386,
      "end_ms": 226623
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "What should I do — for real.",
      "start_ms": 226623,
      "end_ms": 228531
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "In my life.\"",
      "start_ms": 228531,
      "end_ms": 229320
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "Her father was quiet for a very long time.",
      "start_ms": 229320,
      "end_ms": 232235
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "Then he said, in a slow careful voice, \"Mala.",
      "start_ms": 232235,
      "end_ms": 235354
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "If I die when you are still young, this is what I want you to do.",
      "start_ms": 235354,
      "end_ms": 239828
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "Live with Aunt Teuea.",
      "start_ms": 239828,
      "end_ms": 241320
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "She loves you like her own child.",
      "start_ms": 241320,
      "end_ms": 243625
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "She will take care of you.",
      "start_ms": 243625,
      "end_ms": 245455
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "She will get you to finish school.",
      "start_ms": 245455,
      "end_ms": 247828
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "She will make sure you have what you need.",
      "start_ms": 247828,
      "end_ms": 250743
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "And — go to secondary school.",
      "start_ms": 250743,
      "end_ms": 252777
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "Then, if you want, university.",
      "start_ms": 252777,
      "end_ms": 254878
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "There is a scholarship program for Kiribati students to study in Fiji, or Australia, or New Zealand.",
      "start_ms": 254878,
      "end_ms": 261726
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "I have been putting money aside for it.",
      "start_ms": 261726,
      "end_ms": 264437
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "Aunt Teuea knows where the money is.",
      "start_ms": 264437,
      "end_ms": 266946
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "Go and study.",
      "start_ms": 266946,
      "end_ms": 267895
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Come back to Tarawa afterward, if you want to.",
      "start_ms": 267895,
      "end_ms": 271081
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "Or stay in the bigger world.",
      "start_ms": 271081,
      "end_ms": 273047
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Whatever you want.",
      "start_ms": 273047,
      "end_ms": 274335
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "But — do not stop learning.",
      "start_ms": 274335,
      "end_ms": 276234
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "That is what I want most for you.",
      "start_ms": 276234,
      "end_ms": 278539
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "Do not stop learning.\"",
      "start_ms": 278539,
      "end_ms": 280166
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "\"Also — and this is different — I want you to know that a life in Tarawa is a good life.",
      "start_ms": 280166,
      "end_ms": 286199
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "If you decide you want to stay here and be a fisherman like me, or teach school like your Aunt Teuea, or do anything else that keeps you close to home — that is also a full life.",
      "start_ms": 286199,
      "end_ms": 298334
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Do not think that leaving is the only good thing.",
      "start_ms": 298334,
      "end_ms": 301724
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "Some people leave.",
      "start_ms": 301724,
      "end_ms": 303012
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "Some people stay.",
      "start_ms": 303012,
      "end_ms": 304233
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "Both are honest.",
      "start_ms": 304233,
      "end_ms": 305385
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "Whichever one you pick — pick it because it is the one that feels right, not because it is the one that seems bigger.\" He paused.",
      "start_ms": 305385,
      "end_ms": 314198
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "\"Do not worry about me watching.",
      "start_ms": 314198,
      "end_ms": 316435
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "If I am watching, I am proud of you either way.",
      "start_ms": 316435,
      "end_ms": 319690
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "And if I am not watching — well.",
      "start_ms": 319690,
      "end_ms": 321927
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "Then it does not matter.",
      "start_ms": 321927,
      "end_ms": 323622
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "But live for you.",
      "start_ms": 323622,
      "end_ms": 324842
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "Yes?\" Mala said, \"Yes, Papa.\"",
      "start_ms": 324842,
      "end_ms": 326808
    }
  ]
}